    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273856</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Chester&gt;</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Chester&gt;.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273928</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>おわっ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Whoa!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273928</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……っと、
びっくりした……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Hey, you surprised me.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274012</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>なんだよ、&lt;Cless&gt;さんには
休憩しとけって言ってさ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Weren't you just telling &lt;Cless&gt;
he should actually rest?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274092</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>練習しとかないと、
あいつに置いてかれるからな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yeah, but if I don't practice,
that guy'll leave me in the dust.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274164</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……あいつって、
&lt;Cless&gt;さんのこと？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>..."That guy" meaning &lt;Cless&gt;?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274280</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ああ、あれ以上、
あいつに特訓とかされたら、
オレが追いつけない</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yeah, if he keeps it up
like this, I won't be able
to keep pace with him.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274280</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>でも、やるんだよな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>And, he's still training.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274384</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>なんでこそこそすんだよ。
&lt;Chester&gt;も、&lt;Cless&gt;さんと
一緒にやればいいだろ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Why are you being so sneaky
about it, &lt;Chester&gt;? You could
just train together with &lt;Cless&gt;.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274512</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……ふっ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Hah.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274512</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……確かに、
おまえの言うとおりだな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Well, you're not wrong.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274512</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>でも、なんていうかな……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But, how do I put this...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274512</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……男の、プライドだ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...It's my pride as a man!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <BubbleId>3</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274568</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>男の……プライド……？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Pride...as a man...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274616</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そういうこと</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yeah, exactly.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>17</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274688</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ふーん……
なんだかよくわかんねけど</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hmm... Not sure
I get it, honestly.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274756</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ま、そのうち、
おまえにもわかるさ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Well, you'll understand
soon enough.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>19</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274812</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ふっ……！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hoh...!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>20</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274812</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>やっ……！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yah...!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>20</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274888</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>なぁ、&lt;Chester&gt;、
オレも一緒にやっていいか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hey, &lt;Chester&gt;, is it
alright if I join in?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>22</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274980</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ああ、いいぜ。
それじゃあ、オレの
とっておき教えてやるよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yeah, sure. Actually, you
know what? I'll even
teach you a few tricks.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>23</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275068</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>うん、よろしく……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Uh-huh, okay...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>24</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275068</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>じゃなくて、
お願いします！　師匠！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Nah, that sounds awesome!
Please teach me, master!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>24</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275160</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>よし、いい返事だ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Alright, good answer!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>26</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275160</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>でも、この技は気合だけでは
できねーぜ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But you'll need more than just
fighting spirit to pull off this arte.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>26</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275208</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>覚悟はしてるぜ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yeah, but I'm ready.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>28</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275256</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>よし、行くぞ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Alright, let's get started!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>29</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
